            "name": "Le Coup de Foudre Luxury Agency",
            "year": 2024,
            "extract": "Le Coup de Foudre is a bespoke luxury agency created by Clément Le Coz and Justina Socas. Their company specializes in one-of-a-kind curations and memorable moments within the fashion, design and craft industries.",
            "description": "Le Coup de Foudre is a bespoke luxury agency created by Clément Le Coz and Justina Socas. Their company specializes in one-of-a-kind curations and memorable moments within the fashion, design and craft industries. Clément was born in Paris, France. He lived during 10 years in Buenos Aires, Argentina. His family comes from both Brittany and Champagne. His mother holds a beautiful castle in Normandy. He is passionate about Louis the 14th’s vision for France, about mid-century design and about the man elegance promoted by the century-old magazine Monsieur. The silk handkerchiefs from Charvet, a coffee break at Café Varenne and a glaze at food packages at la Grande épicerie du Bon Marché are his main weaknesses. Justina is an international Parisian. She was born in Buenos Aires, Argentina. She is passionate about Renaissance aesthetics, about Jean Auguste Dominique Ingres and mid-century Italian lighting. She is an art historian, the daughter of a renowned interior designer and a reference in fashion styling in both New York and Buenos Aires. The Roger Vivier shoe shop, the Sennelier art store and the Astier de Villatte boutiques are her main weaknesses.",
